  - Logout/revocation matters more, since idle expiry no longer bounds exposure. I don't see any revocation path in this
    repo — the two files here are the whole app surface.

  If that tradeoff is intended, say go and I'll make the one-line change. If the real goal is "users shouldn't get
  logged out mid-work," there's a lower-risk option — a short idle timeout with sliding renewal — but that's a design
  change, so I'd start a brainstorm rather than slip it in.

